# Gotify Push Notification Configuration
# ──────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Install Gotify via community-scripts or Docker.
# 2. Create an Application in the Gotify web UI and copy the token.
# 3. Copy this file to 'gotify.conf' in the same directory as the scripts,
#    or place it at '/etc/pve-gotify.conf'.
# 4. Set secure permissions: chmod 600 gotify.conf
#
# GOTIFY_SERVER: Full URL including protocol (http:// or https://)
# GOTIFY_TOKEN:  Application token from Gotify UI

GOTIFY_SERVER=""
GOTIFY_TOKEN=""
